{"id": 1708, "title": "The Story Of Fang Zhongyong", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "the-story-of-fang-zhongyong", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1708_the-story-of-fang-zhongyong.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["从前，中国有一个非常聪明的孩子，叫“方仲永”。他没有见过笔和纸，但是五岁的时候，他突然哭着要纸和笔，说想写诗。他爸爸借来笔和纸，他拿起笔就写了一首诗，大家都觉得他写得不错。从此，他爸爸每天让他写诗赚钱，但是不让他学习新的知识。所以二十岁的时候，方仲永已经和普通人一样了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["從前，中國有一個非常聰明的孩子，叫“方仲永”。他沒有見過筆和紙，但是五歲的時候，他突然哭著要紙和筆，說想寫詩。他爸爸借來筆和紙，他拿起筆就寫了一首詩，大家都覺得他寫得不錯。從此，他爸爸每天讓他寫詩賺錢，但是不讓他學習新的知識。所以二十歲的時候，方仲永已經和普通人一樣了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["cóng qián， Zhōng guó yǒu yī gè fēi cháng cōng míng de hái zi， jiào“ Fāng Zhòng yǒng”。 tā méi yǒu jiàn guo bǐ hé zhǐ， dàn shì wǔ suì de shí hou， tā tū rán kū zhe yào zhǐ hé bǐ， shuō xiǎng xiě shī。 tā bà ba jiè lái bǐ hé zhǐ， tā ná qǐ bǐ jiù xiě le yī shǒu shī， dà jiā dōu jué de tā xiě de bù cuò。 cóng cǐ， tā bà ba měi tiān ràng tā xiě shī zhuàn qián， dàn shì bù ràng tā xué xí xīn de zhī shi。 suǒ yǐ èr shí suì de shí hou， Fāng Zhòng yǒng yǐ jīng hé pǔ tōng rén yī yàng le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Long ago in China, there was a very clever child named Fang Zhongyong. He had never seen a pen or paper, but when he was five, he suddenly began crying and asking for them, saying he wanted to write a poem. His father borrowed a pen and some paper, and Zhongyong picked up the pen and wrote a poem right away. Everyone thought it was quite good. After that, his father made him write poems to earn money every day, but never let him learn anything new. By the time Zhongyong was twenty, he was no different from anyone else."], "english_full": "Long ago in China, there was a very clever child named Fang Zhongyong. He had never seen a pen or paper, but when he was five, he suddenly began crying and asking for them, saying he wanted to write a poem. His father borrowed a pen and some paper, and Zhongyong picked up the pen and wrote a poem right away. Everyone thought it was quite good. After that, his father made him write poems to earn money every day, but never let him learn anything new. By the time Zhongyong was twenty, he was no different from anyone else.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cóng qián\" data-defn=\"previously / formerly / once upon a time\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">从前</span><span class=\"tr\">從前</span><rt>cóng qián</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhōng guó\" data-defn=\"China\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōng guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fēi cháng\" data-defn=\"very; really\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">非常</span><span class=\"tr\">非常</span><rt>fēi cháng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cōng míng\" data-defn=\"intelligent; clever; bright / acute (of sight and hearing)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">聪明</span><span class=\"tr\">聰明</span><rt>cōng míng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hái zi\" data-defn=\"child\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">孩子</span><span class=\"tr\">孩子</span><rt>hái zi</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiào\" data-defn=\"to be called\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby>“<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Fāng Zhòng yǒng\" data-defn=\"Fang Zhongyong; a child prodigy in a famous Chinese essay whose talents later declined.\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">方仲永</span><span class=\"tr\">方仲永</span><rt>Fāng Zhòng yǒng</rt></ruby>”。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"méi yǒu\" data-defn=\"haven&#x27;t / hasn&#x27;t\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiàn\" data-defn=\"to see / to meet / to appear (to be sth) / to interview\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"guo\" data-defn=\"(experienced action marker)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bǐ\" data-defn=\"writing brush; writing implement / brushstroke; stroke (in painting or calligraphy) / (bound form) style of writing; literary manner; technique of brushwork\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2(5)\"><span class=\"si\">笔</span><span class=\"tr\">筆</span><rt>bǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhǐ\" data-defn=\"paper\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">纸</span><span class=\"tr\">紙</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dàn shì\" data-defn=\"but; however\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǔ\" data-defn=\"five / 5\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr\">五</span><rt>w